action -- the group action that produced a ring of invariants
*************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        action S
  * Inputs:
      * S, an instance of the type *note RingOfInvariants: RingOfInvariants,,
        of the group action being returned
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note GroupAction: GroupAction,, the action
        that produced the ring of invariants in the input

Description
===========

This function is provided by the package *note InvariantRing: Top,.

This example shows how to recover the action of a torus that produced a certain
ring of invariants. Note other action types are possible and may produce a
different looking output.

+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_1..x_4]                                      |
|                                                           |
|o1 = R                                                     |
|                                                           |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T = diagonalAction(matrix {{0,1,-1,1},{1,0,-1,-1}}, R)|
|                                                           |
|             * 2                                           |
|o2 = R <- (QQ )  via                                       |
|                                                           |
|     | 0 1 -1 1  |                                         |
|     | 1 0 -1 -1 |                                         |
|                                                           |
|o2 : DiagonalAction                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : S = R^T                                               |
|                                                           |
|o3 =             2                                         |
|     QQ[x x x , x x x ]                                    |
|         1 2 3   1 3 4                                     |
|                                                           |
|o3 : RingOfInvariants                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : action S                                              |
|                                                           |
|             * 2                                           |
|o4 = R <- (QQ )  via                                       |
|                                                           |
|     | 0 1 -1 1  |                                         |
|     | 1 0 -1 -1 |                                         |
|                                                           |
|o4 : DiagonalAction                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+

