        in the decomposition of the diagonal group

Description
===========

This function is provided by the package *note InvariantRing: Top,. 

Use this function to recover the cyclic abelian factors of a diagonal action on
a polynomial ring.

The following example defines an action of a product of two cyclic groups of
order 3 acting on a three-dimensional vector space.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_1..x_3]           |
|                                |
|o1 = R                          |
|                                |
