+------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : M = matrix{{(z+1)/2, (1-z)/2},{(1-z)/2, (z+1)/2}}|
|                                                      |
|o3 = | 1/2z+1/2  -1/2z+1/2 |                          |
|     | -1/2z+1/2 1/2z+1/2  |                          |
|                                                      |
|             2      2                                 |
|o3 : Matrix S  <-- S                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : sub(M,z=>1),sub(M,z=>-1)                         |
|                                                      |
|o4 = (| 1 0 |, | 0 1 |)                               |
|      | 0 1 |  | 1 0 |                                |
|                                                      |
|o4 : Sequence                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : R = QQ[x,y]                                      |
|                                                      |
|o5 = R                                                |
|                                                      |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : L = linearlyReductiveAction(I, M, R)             |
|                                                      |
|                   2                                  |
|o6 = R <- S/ideal(z  - 1) via                         |
|                                                      |
|     | 1/2z+1/2  -1/2z+1/2 |                          |
|     | -1/2z+1/2 1/2z+1/2  |                          |
|                                                      |
|o6 : LinearlyReductiveAction                          |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : H = hilbertIdeal L                               |
|                                                      |
|                    2                                 |
|o7 = ideal (x + y, y )                                |
|                                                      |
|o7 : Ideal of R                                       |
+------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : apply(H_*, f -> isInvariant(f,L))                |
|                                                      |
|o8 = {true, false}                                    |
|                                                      |
|o8 : List                                             |
