==========================================================

  * "invariantRing(...,UseCoefficientRing=>...)"
  * *note invariants(...,UseCoefficientRing=>...):
    invariants_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmUseCoefficientRing=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, -- option to
    compute invariants over the given coefficient ring

Further information
===================

  * Default value: *note false: (Macaulay2Doc)false,
  * Function: *note invariants: invariants, -- computes the generating
