File: InvariantRing.info, Node: primaryInvariants_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDade=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, Next: primaryInvariants_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDegreeVector=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, Prev: primaryInvariants, Up: Top

primaryInvariants(...,Dade=>...) -- an optional argument for primaryInvariants determining whether to use the Dade algorithm
****************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        primaryInvariants G
  * Inputs:
      * G, an instance of the type *note FiniteGroupAction: FiniteGroupAction,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,,  consisting of a homogeneous system
        of parameters (hsop) for the invariant ring of the group action

Description
===========

*note Dade: primaryInvariants_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmDade=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, takes *note
Boolean: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean, values and is set to *note false:
